      "similarity_group": "dh-transform",
      "statement_en": "Compute **T** using the stated convention: $T=\\operatorname{Rot}(x,\\alpha)\\operatorname{Trans}(x,a)\\operatorname{Trans}(z,d)\\operatorname{Rot}(z,\\phi)$. Both angles below are in **radians**.",
