      "reference_code": "Rx = MatrixExp3(VecToso3(np.array([alpha, 0, 0])))\nRz = MatrixExp3(VecToso3(np.array([0, 0, phi])))\nT = RpToTrans(Rx, np.zeros(3)) @ RpToTrans(np.eye(3), np.array([a, 0, 0])) @ RpToTrans(np.eye(3), np.array([0, 0, d])) @ RpToTrans(Rz, np.zeros(3))",
      "formula_latex": "T=R_x(\\alpha)\\,T_x(a)\\,T_z(d)\\,R_z(\\phi)",
      "explanation_md": "按题目给定顺序相乘。A pure rotation has zero translation. A pure translation has identity rotation.\n\n注意 d 的平移还会被左侧 Rx 旋转，不能直接把位置写成 (a,0,d)。"
